ase-on[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Task-bead gate thresholds and stale-backlog cleanup[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A ready task bead earns a TaskTriage gate only once it has at least[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bead.task_triage.min_plus_ones` +1 reports, every gate already [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]raised below that bar is canceled and its notification dismissed, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and the sub-threshold remainder is swept by a new hourly chop that [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]raises one multi-select BeadStaleCleanup gate as soon as [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bead.task_triage.stale_cleanup_min_beads` beads have sat below the[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bar for `bead.task_triage.stale_after_days` days.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]task_bead_gate_thresholds.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/task_bead_gate_thresholds.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-on[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-on/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Threshold config and TaskTriage suppression[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]triage[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]triage: add the grouped `bead.task_triage` config block with its three [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fields, schema entries, and fail-open accessors, add the shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]staleness/suppression predicates, and teach the bead_task_triage chop to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]withhold a TaskTriage gate from a sub-threshold ready task bead and to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cancel the ones it already raised.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]BeadStaleCleanup gate contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate: build the trusted BeadStaleCleanup gate kind — constants, payload,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-bead select/unselect inputs, spec builder, payload-pure preview, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command wrapper, response translation, adapter registration, and kind [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validation.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]BeadStaleCleanup host effects[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]actions[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]actions: close the beads a reviewer selected, grouped per project [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the locked bead-store mutation and commit path, and route the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]answered gate to that effect from the adapter.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bead_stale_cleanup chop[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chop[dim] · [dim][/dim]after triage, actions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chop: extract the shared enabled-project inventory, add the hourly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead_stale_cleanup chop with its own lane state and reconciliation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]register it in the housekeeping lumberjack and the console-script table,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and drop the epic symbol whitelist entries the earlier phases needed.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation sweep and full verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chop[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: reconcile the axe, notifications, beads, and configuration [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guides against the landed behavior, state the post-land rollout step [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that dismisses the reviewer's existing sub-threshold notifications, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]land a green check-full.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-on","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-on.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-b53d69491078a79e59260a401c2e650b","started_at":"2026-08-17T15:48:59.559805+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"0ce963ab37da9e98c54c97f679f19528f7c0aa45de68751442641fc1019ce9f4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"305cd1f9c96362e012c4ab11627eecae27424be027bd3415cd0a8a12e045fb62","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.3/meta.json","size_bytes":632},"prompt":{"digest":"948bd9a8a9f81146442658a104f6d05551b8a7f7e893d22c947e19af67685f78","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":140},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"34f4119a6164fe7c74468e0323b3b3b95d18306ff40e2b393e97ed914b5e4bec","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.3/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4173},"state":{"digest":"2fb587418e461b3f64c3be1222d6425c7c366da3c63684b167d09b95407ad4f0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.3/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.3","local_name":"sase-on.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-on","agent_clan_generation":